[aA][dD]7|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]4|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]1|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]0|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD][dD][iI][vV][iI][dD][eE]|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]8|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]5|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]2|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD][mM][uU][lL][tT][iI][pP][lL][yY]|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]9|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]6|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD]3|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD][dD][eE][cC][iI][mM][aA][lL]|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD][sS][uU][bB][tT][rR][aA][cC][tT]|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD][aA][dD][dD]|[nN][uU][mM][pP][aA][dD][eE][nN][tT][eE][rR]|[mM][oO][uU][sS][eE][lL][eE][fF][tT]|[mM][oO][uU][sS][eE][mM][iI][dD][dD][lL][eE]|[mM][oO][uU][sS][eE][rR][iI][gG][hH][tT]|[mM][oO][uU][sS][eE][bB][aA][cC][kK]|[mM][oO][uU][sS][eE][fF][oO][rR][wW][aA][rR][dD])$"
    }
  }
